      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SON OF WITCHY (5) got the job done again after leading to make it two in a row, scoring by one length (29.98) at this track over 515m. Looks the testing material. TRACKING ME (1) broke well and quickly mustered speed to win over the 515m at this track two runs back then prominent throughout when finishing second at this track last start. Hard to beat again. VESTA BALE (6) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Finished second (30.14) at this track latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Has a good record at this journey. Has performed well from this box with a win and four minor placings to her name from nine starts. Leading player again. KEEN ON KEV (8) generally performs well over this distance.",
